# Rancor's "put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return it to its owner's hand" never happens (hand stays empty).
# Turn 1 Lion's Eye Diamond discards the Auras into the graveyard; Herald is drawn on turn 3 and paid with Mountain and Sol Ring.

